cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "RecVAE — Recurrent 3D-Conv VAE for fMRI"
abstract: >
  RecVAE is a PyTorch reference implementation of a recurrent 3D-convolutional
  variational autoencoder for temporal fMRI volumes, developed in the context
  of Alzheimer's-related ADNI cohorts. The repository pairs the model with an
  18-lesson tutorial series and a synthetic-data on-ramp so that learners new
  to deep learning for neuroimaging can read, run, and extend the code without
  requiring access to ADNI.
authors:
